1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,047
Well, in the more traditional workplaces, people's working lives and their private lives are, or were, clearly divided.

2
00:00:09,147 --> 00:00:14,627
People often work from 9 in the morning until 5 or 6 in the evening.

3
00:00:14,679 --> 00:00:19,155
People sometimes stay late in the office and work in the evenings.

4
00:00:19,205 --> 00:00:24,693
This is called working overtime. OK, and what else?

5
00:00:24,743 --> 00:00:32,820
Well, in these environments, It isn't common for people to work at the weekend or while they're on holiday.

6
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:37,781
They can clearly separate their working lives and their private lives.
